  <!-- Framework 0.178.0 (docs/development/parts-bills.md, "Aircraft and turbine parts"; owner, 19 Nov 2026): the turbine is built around
       a blade set of its own, an intermediate the owner asked for so its worth rests on what is in it. About 1,550 where it was about 600,
       beside RimThunder's turbine at 2,500, much of whose worth is 500 steel of casting. Figures authored. -->
