  <!-- Framework 0.179.0 (docs/development/parts-bills.md, "The second pass"; owner, 20 Nov 2026: make it): a heavy electric machine, a motor
       or, turned by an engine, a generator. A generator set's traction motors and main generator, a locomotive's traction motor, an electric
       pump or hydraulic power pack, a winch or a hoist. Steel stands for its iron core and frame, components for its windings and controls
       (the game has no copper). Recipe, work, skill, mass and worth authored, worth near what it is made of. -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>PhobosVehicles_ElectricMotor</defName>
    <label>electric motor</label>
    <description>A heavy industrial electric motor with its terminal box and cooling fan. It drives a traction axle, a pump, a winch or a hoist; turned by an engine instead, the same machine is a generator.</description>
